===== Bootloader =====

The Bootloader used in this unit is U-Boot . It is available through the serial interface with the settings: 57600/8-N-1 (flow control: none) \\

==== Recovery via HTTP ====

Emergency HTTP server IP address is 192.168.1.6. Internet Explorer browser is supported.

==== Recovery via serial console ====

If, for some reason, your router cannot boot any more, there is a good chance that the original bootloader is still working.
To check, connect to the serial port and do router power cycle:

